          "title": "Make a JI scale",
          "body": "Build a scale from the intervals of the 15-odd-limit, or start from a preset such as Ptolemy's intense diatonic and change it. It needs at least five notes, counting 1/1. Save the scale when it sounds right; the next exercises use it.",
