          "kind": "make",
          "task": "ji-melody",
          "title": "Write a melody in a JI scale",
          "body": "The piano roll holds your saved scale over a 1/1 drone, eight bars of 4/4. Write a melody of at least eight notes that uses at least four different pitches and comes to rest on one or two clear ratios. Export it to finish.",
