          "title": "Find a chord in a JI scale",
          "body": "On the Chords lane, sound three or more notes of your scale together over the drone and read the ratios they form above 1/1. A still, beatless chord such as 4:5:6 (1/1, 5/4, 3/2) is the sound to look for. Save to finish.",
